# A help desk with pickers that differ from reading, and a role.
# - Customers are private to the agent who owns them, but any agent can pick
#   any customer for a ticket. Supervisors see every customer.
# - Tickets can only be filed under teams you lead (a named picker).
# - Only Supervisors delete tickets.
Identity
    Registration Enabled

Role Supervisor

Entity Customer
    Field Name Text(200)
    Field Email Email
    Field Owner -> Identity

Entity Team
    Field Name Text(100)
    Field Lead -> Identity

Entity Ticket
    Field Subject Text(200)
    Field Customer -> Customer
    Field Team -> Team Pick Mine
    Field Priority Enum(Low, Normal, Urgent) = Normal
    Field Status Enum(Open, Waiting, Solved) = Open
    Field Assignee -> Identity?
    Field Details Text(4000)?

    Present
        Listing
            Fields Subject, Customer, Team, Priority, Status, Assignee
        Creating
            Input Customer
                Picker Modal

Action Create, Update, Delete Customer
    By Owner

Action Read Customer
    By Owner
    By Supervisor

Action Pick Customer
    By Authenticated
    SearchBy Name, Email

Action Create, Read Team
    By Authenticated

Action Pick Team As Mine
    By Lead

Action Create, Read, Update Ticket
    By Authenticated
    OrderBy Priority Desc

Action Delete Ticket
    By Supervisor
